<%#
  The design's AI Suggested Content panel. No generation provider is connected,
  so suggesting content would mean inventing it. The panel keeps its place and
  says what it is waiting for rather than showing a fabricated idea.
%>
<section class="rounded-card border border-border bg-lavender-soft p-5">
  <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
    <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-lg font-normal">
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-warning">&#10022;</span>
      Suggested content
    </h2>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-body">
    Prachar will suggest ideas here &mdash; built from your catalog, your brand tone
    and what has actually worked for you.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted">
    Waiting on content generation, which is not connected yet.
  </p>
</section>
